wait 120ms
wait 500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 49065 casts >= 42
expect hu spell 49065 casts <= 80
as gm .unlearn 900575

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- wave 3
log BM - 900509 setup: the hunter gets its Snow Tracker Wolf and stands 15 yd west of d1
do hu learn 900509
do hu tame 1138
waitfor hu pet timeout 5s
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 2s
pick pt creature:1138 near hu
require pt exists

log BM - 900509 "switch position with our pet and enraging both of you for 10 seconds for +30% damage. 60 seconds cooldown.": the hunter jumps 25 yd away from the pet and casts Switch Places at once - afterwards the hunter stands where the pet stood (west) and the pet where the hunter stood (north-east), both carry Switched Fury (900510, 10 s), the cooldown is 60 s
do hu goto -270 170 -423.2
do hu cast 900509
wait 200ms
expect hu near -288.9 150 -423.2 7
expect pt near -270 170 -423.2 9
expect hu aura 900510
expect pt aura 900510
expect hu auramaxduration 900510 == 10000
expect hu cooldown 900509 > 50000

log BM - 900509 ten seconds later the enrage is gone from both
wait 10500ms
expect hu noaura 900510
expect pt noaura 900510
do hu goto -288.9 150 -423.2
wait 1s

log Survival - 900576 "trap grab: pulls together all traps within 40y range and throws them at the target": a Frost Trap and an Explosive Trap laid at the hunter's feet 21 yd west of d1 - both trap objects stand, then Trap Grab at d1 removes them both and sets off both effects at d1: the Explosive Trap Effect (49065) reaches the ring (6 dummies or more), the Frost Trap Effect (13810) is cast, one cast of Trap Grab, a 30 s cooldown
do hu learn 13809
do hu learn 49067
do hu learn 900576
do hu goto -295 150 -423.2
wait 500ms
do hu reset
do hu cast 13809 triggered
wait 300ms
do hu cast 49067 triggered
wait 500ms
expect gameobject:164639 exists
expect gameobject:189322 exists
spelllog start
do hu cast 900576 on d1
wait 1500ms
spelllog stop
expect hu spell 900576 casts == 1
expect gameobject:164639 missing
expect gameobject:189322 missing
expect hu spell 13810 casts >= 1
expect hu spell 49065 casts >= 1
expect hu spell 49065 targets >= 6
expect hu cooldown 900576 > 20000
as gm .unlearn 900576
as gm .unlearn 900509

cleanup
do hu stop
do gm target hu
as gm .unlearn 900573
as gm .unlearn 900574
as gm .unlearn 900575
as gm .unlearn 13809
as gm .unlearn 900509
as gm .unlearn 900576
as gm .unaura 900510
